# =====================================================================
# Release V106 -- NHS_Charge boolean fix (real Dentally shape)
# =====================================================================
# Real Dentally sends invoice_items.nhs_charge as a BOOLEAN ('True'/'False'); the mock sent a
# numeric, so Bronze.usp_Load_Invoice_Items did CAST(TRY_CAST(nhs_charge AS DECIMAL) AS INT) which
# nulled every real 'True'/'False' -> Silver bit 0 -> Gold 0 -> "NHS Revenue" blank on real tenants.
# Fix maps bool -> 1/0 (numeric fallback kept) so the existing NHS/Private split ([NHS Charge] > 0)
# classifies correctly. Bronze column stays int (holds 0/1); Silver already bit; no schema change.
# Deploy the SP, then re-run the load chain (Orchestrate_Build, or Bronze->Silver->Gold for
# invoice_items) so the MERGE re-reads init_stage and updates the existing NULL NHS_Charge rows.
# Run: .\Scripts\Deploy.ps1 -Manifest Releases\V106__nhs_charge_bool.manifest -SkipTests
# =====================================================================

DEPLOY   Fabric\Bronze.usp_Load_Invoice_Items.StoredProcedure.sql

TEST
